ns at once. One team planning and supervising the interiors keeps the style and quality the same in every room.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>City-Standard Interiors in Karnal</h2>\n            <p>A well-designed home adds comfort and lasting value. Our interior design services bring that within reach for Karnal families and businesses.</p><p>Planning work in Karnal? <a href=\"/karnal/contact\">Ask 9th Corner for a proposal</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}